imud (1.6-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * TCP outputs for NMEA, the framed binary stream, Signal K, and MAVLink
    (per-output tcp_enabled/tcp_bind_addr/tcp_port keys); libimud gains
    imud_connect_tcp (additive, SONAME unchanged).
  * BEHAVIOR CHANGE: built-in defaults now enable only the local AF_UNIX
    stream socket (NMEA UDP default flipped to off); set [nmea]
    enabled = true to restore the old posture.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Sun, 19 Jul 2026 12:00:00 -0700

imud (1.5.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix C11 data races in config hot-reload and stream shutdown; validate
    gpsd/Signal K numeric input; log pthread errors via the return code.
    (ThreadSanitizer coverage added.)

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Wed, 15 Jul 2026 12:00:00 -0700

imud (1.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial multi-binary Debian packaging: imud, imud-utils, libimud0,
    libimud-dev, the five bridge daemons, and imud-wmm-data, built from
    the upstream Makefile install targets.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Sun, 12 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0700
